WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.150
The story begins with allo, a natural fibre gathered by hand in Nepal’s hills.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.950
Before it can become thread, the raw fibre is carefully prepared by hand.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.800
Prepared fibre is twisted into yarn, then arranged into the ordered lines that will become the warp.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.650
On the wooden handloom, warp and weft cross again and again, until separate threads become a single cloth.
